\title{Horn glueing}
\author{samueltoth}
\date{2026-06-24}
\taxon{Module}
\import{stt-macros}

\subtree[tot-ABDE]{
\taxon{Idea}
\author{samueltoth}

\p{In \ref{Synthetic.Categories.DirectedGlueing}, a glue type is used to give an
equivalence between [covariant families](stt-00AY) over #{\Gamma \times \Delta^1} and
pairs of covariant families over #{\Gamma} and maps between them
(\ref{stt-00V2}); this in turn shows that
the [category of Spaces](stt-00AS) is directed univalent (\ref{stt-00AT}).
In this module we extend this construction to equivalences between covariant families
over #{\Gamma \times \Delta^2} and tripples of covariant families and composable
maps between them. This is a crucial ingredient in the proof that [the category of
Spaces is Segal](tot-YE55).}
}

